{"id":"eef042bf719a964a","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-thm-shelah.md","title":"Shelah's Theorem","display":"thm-shelah — Shelah's Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-shelah","aliases":["58-thm-shelah"],"display":"thm-shelah — Shelah's Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-cardinal8-singular-strong-limit-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-cardinalexpp.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-aleph.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-shelah"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-shelah</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-shelah — Shelah's Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"54f09c79ea4411d8\" href=\"?note=54f09c79ea4411d8\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-zfc-cardinal8-singular-strong-limit-cardinal.md\">../batch06/58-df-zfc-cardinal8-singular-strong-limit-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"949691fe1747f59d\" href=\"?note=949691fe1747f59d\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-cardinalexpp.md\">../batch14/58-df-cardinalexpp.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"535817bf563314f5\" href=\"?note=535817bf563314f5\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-aleph.md\">../batch17/58-df-aleph.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_\\omega\">\\(\\aleph_\\omega\\)</span> is the first singular limit of the sequence of infinite alephs</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_4\">\\(\\omega_4\\)</span> is the fourth uncountable initial ordinal</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCardinal8SingularStrongLimitCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCardinal8SingularStrongLimitCardinal}_S\\)</span> is the imported predicate</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CardExp}_S(\\theta,\\kappa,\\lambda)\">\\(\\mathrm{CardExp}_S(\\theta,\\kappa,\\lambda)\\)</span> is the imported typed equation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta=\\kappa^\\lambda\">\\(\\theta=\\kappa^\\lambda\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}shelah}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCardinal8SingularStrongLimitCardinal}_S(\\aleph_\\omega)\n\\to\\exists\\theta\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{CardExp}_S(\\theta,2,\\aleph_\\omega)\n\\land\\theta&lt;\\aleph_{\\omega_4}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}shelah}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCardinal8SingularStrongLimitCardinal}_S(\\aleph_\\omega)\n\\to\\exists\\theta\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{CardExp}_S(\\theta,2,\\aleph_\\omega)\n\\land\\theta&lt;\\aleph_{\\omega_4}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is Shelah's classical PCF upper bound for a strong-limit <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_\\omega\">\\(\\aleph_\\omega\\)</span>.  Cardinal exponentiation is expressed through the imported three-place graph predicate, fixing the base/exponent types explicitly.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-zfc-cardinal8-singular-strong-limit-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"54f09c79ea4411d8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-cardinal8-singular-strong-limit-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-cardinalexpp.md","status":"resolved","id":"949691fe1747f59d","anchor":"ref-2","tar